<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Enterprise Discord Bot Dashboard</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    
    body {
      font-family: 'Outfit', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Display', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #080c14;
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 18%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25) 0%, transparent 45%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 82% 22%, rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.2) 0%, transparent 45%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 65%, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.14) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 75% 85%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.18) 0%, transparent 45%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 25% 85%, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.14) 0%, transparent 42%);
      background-attachment: fixed;
      background-size: cover;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      padding: 1.25rem 3.5rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.65);
      backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #818cf8;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.7rem 1.45rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.95), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.9));
      color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.98), rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.95));
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    }
    .btn-outline {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      color: #f1f5f9;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    }
    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .hero {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.45rem 1.25rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      color: #a5b4fc;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 3.25rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.8px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 30%, #94a3b8 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      max-width: 820px;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }
    p.lead {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: #94a3b8;
      max-width: 620px;
      margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .cta-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.15rem;
      margin-bottom: 3.75rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      max-width: 920px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .stat-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(160%);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(160%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13);
      padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
    .stat-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    }
    .stat-value {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #38bdf8;
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .stat-label {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #94a3b8;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.6px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    footer {
      padding: 1.75rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: #64748b;
      background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.5);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved" style="color: #6366f1;"></i> Discord Enterprise Bot</div>
    <nav>
      <% if (user) { %>
        <span style="margin-right: 1rem; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fa-regular fa-user" style="color: #94a3b8; margin-right: 0.35rem;"></i>Halo, <strong><%= user.username %></strong></span>
        <a href="/guilds" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa-solid fa-sliders"></i> Kelola Server</a>
        <a href="/auth/logout" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-left: 0.5rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-from-bracket"></i> Keluar</a>
      <% } else { %>
        <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa-brands fa-discord"></i> Masuk via Discord</a>
      <% } %>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="hero">
    <div class="badge"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" style="color: #4ade80;"></i> Enterprise Ready • 24/7 PM2 Uptime</div>
    <h1>Kendali Penuh Komunitas Discord Anda</h1>
    <p class="lead">Solusi enterprise terintegrasi untuk moderasi otomatis, sistem tiket pendukung, leveling, giveaways, dan audit trail berbasis PostgreSQL & Node.js.</p>

    <div class="cta-group">
      <% if (user) { %>
        <a href="/guilds" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 0.85rem 2rem; font-size: 1.1rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i> Buka Dashboard</a>
      <% } else { %>
        <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 0.85rem 2rem; font-size: 1.1rem;"><i class="fa-brands fa-discord"></i> Masuk dengan Discord</a>
      <% } %>
      <a href="/health" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem; font-size: 1.1rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i> Status Sistem</a>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div style="font-size: 1.6rem; color: #818cf8; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-server"></i></div>
        <div class="stat-value"><%= stats.guilds %></div>
        <div class="stat-label">Total Server</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div style="font-size: 1.6rem; color: #38bdf8; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i></div>
        <div class="stat-value"><%= stats.users %></div>
        <div class="stat-label">Pengguna Terlayani</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div style="font-size: 1.6rem; color: #34d399; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i></div>
        <div class="stat-value"><%= stats.ping %>ms</div>
        <div class="stat-label">WebSocket Ping</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div style="font-size: 1.6rem; color: #fbbf24; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i></div>
        <div class="stat-value"><%= stats.uptime %></div>
        <div class="stat-label">Uptime Berjalan</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    Discord Bot Enterprise Edition • Didukung oleh Node.js, Discord.js, Prisma, dan PM2
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
